          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Ghost Whey is a well-made, fully disclosed whey blend with some of the best-liked flavors on the market. You pay for that: roughly $1.60 to $2.10 per 25 g of protein, with no sport certification we could find. Buy Ghost Whey for flavor, Clear Whey for a light and lean shake, and Vegan V2 if you are plant-based.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
